terva-sh/tuwunel
================

This repository is terva-sh's release mirror of tuwunel, a Matrix homeserver:

  https://github.com/matrix-construct/tuwunel

tuwunel is Copyright the tuwunel contributors and is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, in LICENSE. tuwunel is the successor to
conduwuit (https://github.com/x86pup/conduwuit), which was a fork of Conduit
(https://gitlab.com/famedly/conduit); their code and authorship are carried
in this history. This repository is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of
those projects.

Our changes are licensed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.


Upstream base
-------------

This release is built on upstream tuwunel v1.9.2:

  c991bca17fbcd02c41f76d759986c5372a9968c4

Every commit up to that one is upstream's, unchanged. The commits after it
are terva-sh's.


